    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2601.08584v1</id>
    <title>Ministral 3</title>
    <updated>2026-01-13T14:06:03Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.08584v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.08584v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We introduce the Ministral 3 series, a family of parameter-efficient dense language models designed for compute and memory constrained applications, available in three model sizes: 3B, 8B, and 14B parameters. For each model size, we release three variants: a pretrained base model for general-purpose use, an instruction finetuned, and a reasoning model for complex problem-solving. In addition, we present our recipe to derive the Ministral 3 models through Cascade Distillation, an iterative pruning and continued training with distillation technique. Each model comes with image understanding capabilities, all under the Apache 2.0 license.</summary>
